space lié":"Acknowledgement in bound workspace","h2a · agents, Focus et Track":"h2a · agents, Focus & Track","Amendement Track":"Track amendment","Fil résolu ≠ item Track clôturé":"Resolved thread ≠ closed Track item","Capture mémoire":"Memory capture","Demande explicite · 6 outils MCP gelés":"Explicit request · 6 frozen MCP tools","Portes de gouvernance et périmètre":"Governance & scope gates","Engram · admission de leçon":"Engram · optional lesson admission","Journal D3 et graphe":"D3 log/D10 graph","Admission tracée · retrait et oubli":"Traced admission · withdraw/forget","Aucune fuite entre namespaces":"No cross-namespace leakage","Profils d’ontologie":"Ontology profiles","Identifiants EN · anciens alias en lecture":"English IDs · legacy read aliases","1. Graphes · Engram gardien WP9":"1. Graphs · Engram WP9 custodian",SemanticDocument:mc,"Sous-graphes liés et dépliables":"Containers expand into linked subgraphs","Skill Focus":"Focus skill","Synthèse : DecisionDossierDocument":"Synthesis: DecisionDossierDocument","DS : rendu <st-decision-dossier>":"DS: <st-decision-dossier> renderer","3. Skills · synthèse par usage":"3. Skills · synthesis per use case","MCP ui:// et canvas":"MCP ui:// & canvases","Skills : architecture, BPMN, audit":"Skills: architecture, BPMN, audit","Registres cluster-mesh · Option E":"cluster-mesh registries · Option E","Layout en JS local":"Layout in local JS","diagram-canvas · routage orthogonal":"diagram-canvas · orthogonal routing","Sugiyama · labels · couverture ELK":"Sugiyama · labels · ELK coverage","2. DS · layout et autonomie JS":"2. DS · JS layout & autonomy","Éditions atomiques":"Atomic edits","SemanticDocument ↔ ViewDocument":"SemanticDocument ↔ ViewDocument","Recalcul local · sémantique ≠ géométrie":"Local recompute: semantics ≠ geometry","Hors ligne sans CDN":"Offline without CDN","JS autonome embarqué · Focus/canvas":"Standalone JS · Focus/canvases","Aucun CDN · JS embarqué, même 32 Mo":"No CDN · embedded JS, even 32 MB","bpmn@1 ↔ moddle F1":"bpmn@1 ↔ moddle F1","Préserve extensionElements/xmlns/xsi":"Preserves extensionElements/xmlns/xsi","Sans perte · modèle BPMN unique":"Lossless round trip · single BPMN model","BPMN/D2D · modèle unique":"BPMN/D2D · single model","Profil canonique":"Canonical profile","Hachage stable · watermark serveur":"Stable hash · server watermark","Clé watermark absente du JS client":"Watermark key excluded from client JS","Build/rendu SHA-256":"SHA-256 build/render","Validation/rendu local et synchrone":"Local synchronous validation/rendering","Outil ontology_call":"ontology_call tool","Registre cluster-mesh et catalogue":"cluster-mesh registry & catalog","Agents : requêtes/validation de profils":"Agents: profile queries/validation","Journal canonique D3":"Canonical D3 log","Seule autorité : admission/retrait/oubli":"Admit/withdraw/forget: sole authority","MCP v3.2 : 6 outils mémoire gelés":"MCP v3.2: 6 frozen memory tools","Engram · mémoire D3/D10":"Engram · D3/D10 memory","Graphe D10 filtré":"Filtered D10 graph",".engram/graph.json purgé à l’oubli":".engram/graph.json purged on forgetting","Non-résurrection X4 · purge X2/X2b":"No resurrection X4 · purge X2/X2b","Service des temps":"Timing service","P50/P80/P95 · 4 horloges · config":"P50/P80/P95 · 4 clocks · config","Observations CI/CD #698 · agent-stats":"CI/CD observations #698 · agent-stats","Engram · temps D1=C":"Engram · D1=C timing","Exports de savoir Git":"Git knowledge exports","Manifestes, temps CI, architecture":"Manifests, CI timings, architecture","Aucun MemoryRef dans Git":"No MemoryRef in Git","1. Interface stockage":"1. Storage interface","DB neutre · 3 surfaces optimisées":"Neutral DB · 3 optimised surfaces","Trans./analyse/graphe · identité/scope":"Tx/analytics/graph · identity/scope","Sentropic · mémoire d’abord":"Sentropic · memory first","2. Transactionnel":"2. Transactional","SQLite (Node 24), puis Postgres":"SQLite (Node 24), then Postgres","6 MCP à qualifier · deny-as-missing":"6 MCP unq