ptimisées, SQLite et Postgres prioritaires ; qualification transactionnelle E2/L5 sur SQLite (Node 24) avant Postgres, analytique et graphe live à qualifier séparément. Les éléments Postgres/S3 #684 observés ne prouvent pas cette qualification. La gouvernance des ontologies ne bloque jamais la chaîne mémoire ; aucun MemoryRef dans Git.","parentContainerIds":["engram","cluster-mesh","h2a"],"legend":"Maquette statique d’étude (SVG autonome hors-ligne). Cadres : systèmes de référence et conteneurs ouvrables. Ambre : cible contractuelle ou brique en qualification ; bleu : identité, 2FA, mandats et garde des accès. Flèches pleines : liaisons du croquis ou routes actives ; pointillés : ajout proposé ou raccordement en cours.","nodes":[{"id":"mem-d3","parentId":"mem-core","position":{"x":40,"y":245.3875},"width":460,"height":200,"data":{"title":"Journal canonique D3","function":"Seule autorité : admission/retrait/oubli","detail":"MCP v3.2 : 6 outils mémoire gelés","tone":"proposal","kind":"component","layoutWidth":460,"text":{"title":["Journal canonique D3"],"function":["Seule autorité : admission/retrait/oubli"],"detail":["MCP v3.2 : 6 outils mémoire gelés"]},"fontScale":1.7142857142857142,"cardIcon":"window","kicker":"COMPOSANT","cardFooter":"Engram · mémoire D3/D10","cardTier":"service","layoutHeight":200}},{"id":"mem-d10","parentId":"mem-core","position":{"x":740,"y":245.3875},"width":460,"height":200,"data":{"title":"Graphe D10 filtré","function":".engram/graph.json purgé à l’oubli","detail":"Non-résurrection X4 · purge X2/X2b","tone":"proposal","kind":"component","layoutWidth":460,"text":{"title":["Graphe D10 filtré"],"function":[".engram/graph.json purgé à l’oubli"],"detail":["Non-résurrection X4 · purge X2/X2b"]},"fontScale":1.7142857142857142,"cardIcon":"window","kicker":"COMPOSANT","cardFooter":"Engram · mémoire D3/D10","cardTier":"service","layoutHeight":200}},{"id":"time-center","parentId":"mem-time","position":{"x":1520,"y":245.3875},"width":460,"height":200,"