cenes":{}}`),Y2=JSON.parse(`{"architectureScenes":{"central":{"id":"central","title":"Central diagram · Unified governance and need routing","shortCaption":"h2a, Engram, Sentropic and Design System; CLI, Cowork, Cloud and AI provider access. Frames classify responsibilities; arrows follow the selected need.","caption":"Owner feedback dated 18 October 2026 is preserved in full in the Owner feedback appendix (screenshots 24, 22, 23). The requested classification is shown here; implementation qualification remains separate. Storage: a neutral DB interface owned by Sentropic/cluster-mesh; optimised transactional, analytical and live graph surfaces; SQLite and Postgres first. E2/L5 must qualify transactions on SQLite (Node 24), then Postgres; Postgres/S3 #684 evidence does not qualify this target. LLM mesh/gateway: published code; JEV judge: on a branch. ChatGPT/Gemini/Claude/Muse connections and SAM-YOLO/TTS/STT families: qualification pending. Sources: OWNER-REQUEST.md, ../cluster-mesh-storage/OWNER-ORIENTATIONS.md, owner-diagram-decisions-via-hcond.md, OWNER-FEEDBACK-RAW.md, proposal-astra.md, h2a.md and engram.md. The initial C01–C14 map still awaits the owner’s map.","legend":"Frames: responsibilities and catalogue families. Amber: proposed target or qualification in progress; blue: security and mandates. Arrows: named relationships in the selected route; dotted lines: proposed connections. The full view shows the main connections; each need reveals its own relationships.","parentContainerIds":[],"nodes":[{"id":"h2a-roles","parentId":"h2a","position":{"x":16,"y":173.3875},"width":460,"height":200,"data":{"title":"Roles and mandates","function":"Human–agent organisation · C01","detail":"RACI · verified actors · scope-guard","tone":"identity","kind":"component","layoutWidth":460,"text":{"title":["Roles and mandates"],"function":["Human–agent organisation · C01"],"detail":["RACI · verified actors · scope-guard"]},"fontScale":1.7142857142857142,"cardIcon":"people","kick