: owner-diagram-decisions-via-hcond.md (2026-10-18): (1) « Les algo open licence libre ou algo public mais dans notre js a nous … On respect mais on libere au max et on a nos propres souches »; (2) « diagrammes gigogne (ouvrables) … Tout diagramme est un graph et toute representation est une forme de synthese. Il faut bie modeliser diagramme layout et skills de presentation »; (3) « L enjeu n est pas la taille mais la reactivité et l atomicité des editions … la acapacite offline sans cdn doit etre possible donc ok la 32Mo qd js embedb ». Note: the five SVG scenes in this dossier are static study mockups illustrating the target; dynamic projection from SemanticDocument will be connected at milestone M4.","parentContainerIds":["engram","design-system","h2a"],"legend":"Static study mockup (standalone offline SVG). Frames: reference systems and expandable containers. Amber: contractual target or component undergoing qualification; blue: identity, 2FA, mandates and access custody. Solid arrows: sketch connections or active routes; dotted arrows: proposed additions or connections in progress.","nodes":[{"id":"onto-profiles","parentId":"onto-graph","position":{"x":40,"y":245.3875},"width":460,"height":200,"data":{"title":"Ontology profiles","function":"dev · track · archi · generic@1 · bpmn@1","detail":"English IDs · legacy read aliases","tone":"proposal","kind":"component","layoutWidth":460,"text":{"title":["Ontology profiles"],"function":["dev · track · archi · generic@1 · bpmn@1"],"detail":["English IDs · legacy read aliases"]},"fontScale":1.7142857142857142,"cardIcon":"window","kicker":"COMPONENT","cardFooter":"1. Graphs · Engram WP9 custodian","cardTier":"service","layoutHeight":200}},{"id":"onto-gigogne","parentId":"onto-graph","position":{"x":740,"y":245.3875},"width":460,"height":200,"data":{"title":"SemanticDocument","function":"Containers expand into linked subgraphs","detail":"DS executor · Engram profiles","tone":"proposal","kind":"component","layoutWidth":460,